        <Index>59</Index>
        <Symbol>SW_ADJUSTDATE</Symbol>
        <Comment>Contains two sets of 8 bits to adjust current date.The operation is always performed on rising edge of the bit. This word is enabled by bit %S59</Comment>
      </MemoryWord>
